  "installation_blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This package and the next two (Expect and DejaGNU) are installed to support running the test suites for Binutils, GCC and other packages. Installing three packages for testing purposes may seem excessive, but it is very reassuring, if not essential, to know that the most important tools are working properly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Prepare Tcl for compilation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "definition-list",
      "title": "The meaning of the new configure parameters:",
      "items": [
        {
          "term_content": [
            {
              "type": "parameter",
              "text": "--disable-rpath"
            }
          ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "This parameter prevents hard coding library search paths (rpath) into the binary executable files and shared libraries. This package does not need rpath for an installation into the standard location, and rpath may sometimes cause unwanted effects or even security issues."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Build the package:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The various"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "sed"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "instructions after the"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "make"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "command remove references to the build directory from the configuration files and replace them with the install directory. This is not mandatory for the remainder of LFS, but may be needed if a package built later uses Tcl."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To test the results, issue:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Install the package:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Make the installed library writable so debugging symbols can be removed later:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Install Tcl's headers. The next package, Expect, requires them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now make a necessary symbolic link:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Rename a man page that conflicts with a Perl man page:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "command_index": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Optionally, install the documentation by issuing the following commands:"
